ref":"#/texts/65","text":"C12"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"(a)","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":662.980236,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":377.4697,"r":386.07109,"t":670.2797939999999},"charspan":[0,3],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/66","text":"(a)"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C1","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":737.866475,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":439.9899,"r":445.9573715,"t":745.198625},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/67","text":"C1"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C2","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":729.121475,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":457.4109,"r":463.3974715,"t":736.4293250000001},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/68","text":"C2"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C3","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":737.0854750000001,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":478.7289,"r":484.7164715,"t":744.418625},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/69","text":"C3"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C4","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":731.081375,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":494.762,"r":500.7407583,"t":738.402625},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/70","text":"C4"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C5","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":722.928275,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":439.3188,"r":445.2977583,"t":730.243525},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/71","text":"C5"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C6","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":716.165475,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":477.2619,"r":483.2445715,"t":723.473325},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/72","text":"C6"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C7","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":706.591275,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":436.6439,"r":442.6326583,"t":713.912525},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/73","text":"C7"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C8","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":703.984375,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":460.0609,"r":466.04747150000003,"t":711.298225},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/74","text":"C8"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C9","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":703.840375,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":490.278,"r":496.2504715,"t":711.167525},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/75","text":"C9"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C11","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":685.679375,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":465.3549,"r":473.5656164,"t":693.0086249999999},"charspan":[0,3],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/76","text":"C11"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C12","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":682.9323750000001,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":489.5769,"r":497.79261640000004,"t":690.240225},"charspan":[0,3],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/77","text":"C12"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"C10","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":683.5283750000001,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":438.5929,"r":446.8186164,"t":690.837225},"charspan":[0,3],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/78","text":"C10"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"(b)","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":662.980236,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":462.5949,"r":471.63023400000003,"t":670.2797939999999},"charspan":[0,3],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/79","text":"(b)"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"has at least a neighbor in b i m . To simplify the analysis, we suppose there are not sink nodes at b i m or δ i m . The nodes in b i m and δ i m are not in cluster-contained-subnets. Name Φ i = b i m ∪ δ i m . Fig. 5(a) illustrates the example Φ 1 of c 1 . Then we calculate MVC on Φ i as λ i . We use λ i as alternative border nodes to b i m . Because each edge in Φ i has at least one endpoint in the MVC nodes λ i , so monitoring λ i can capture all the flows passing over Φ i . The number of λ i is not necessarily smaller than b i m . Therefore, we select Min {| b i m | , | λ i |} as the new border nodes of c i m . If λ i are selected as the border nodes of cluster c i m , the non-VC nodes in b i m do not need to monitor the flow, and their cluster-ID are set to the neighbor cluster.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":461.23021679999994,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.32239072,"r":547.4199582000003,"t":598.300433},"charspan":[0,794],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/80","text":"has at least a neighbor in b i m . To simplify the analysis, we suppose there are not sink nodes at b i m or δ i m . The nodes in b i m and δ i m are not in cluster-contained-subnets. Name Φ i = b i m ∪ δ i m . Fig. 5(a) illustrates the example Φ 1 of c 1 . Then we calculate MVC on Φ i as λ i . We use λ i as alternative border nodes to b i m . Because each edge in Φ i has at least one endpoint in the MVC nodes λ i , so monitoring λ i can capture all the flows passing over Φ i . The number of λ i is not necessarily smaller than b i m . Therefore, we select Min {| b i m | , | λ i |} as the new border nodes of c i m . If λ i are selected as the border nodes of cluster c i m , the non-VC nodes in b i m do not need to monitor the flow, and their cluster-ID are set to the neighbor cluster."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"C. Protocol for Cluster based SD-WSN","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":433.30666575641374,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.32239072,"r":460.9362371199998,"t":441.81907199999995},"charspan":[0,36],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/81","text":"C. Protocol for Cluster based SD-WSN"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"CluFlow makes the SDN controller estimate flow among clusters by monitoring the flow at border nodes. The SDN controller controls traffic flow by injecting cluster-level routing rules to the border nodes. The management procedure of the SDN controller and nodes in WSN is shown in Alg. 3.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":367.8416881199999,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.32239072,"r":547.4243169199997,"t":423.46178575999994},"charspan":[0,288],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/82","text":"CluFlow makes the SDN controller estimate flow among clusters by monitoring the flow at border nodes. The SDN controller controls traffic flow by injecting cluster-level routing rules to the border nodes. The management procedure of the SDN controller and nodes in WSN is shown in Alg. 3."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"There are at least two benefits of utilizing SDN control in cluster-level routing. Firstly, compared with SDN management for every node in WSN, CluFlow trades granularity of SDN control for less communication load. Only cluster border nodes communicate with the SDN controller. The number of nodes that communicate with the SDN controller decreases. Secondly, cluster-level routing and local routing are decoupled. The nodes inside the clusters use only distributed local routing and do not need to request flow table entries from the SDN controller. The communication delay caused by requesting flow table entries therefore decreases.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":238.80891205999978,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.32239072,"r":547.4243169199998,"t":364.1706183199999},"charspan":[0,635],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/83","text":"There are at least two benefits of utilizing SDN control in cluster-level routing. Firstly, compared with SDN management for every node in WSN, CluFlow trades granularity of SDN control for less communication load. Only cluster border nodes communicate with the SDN controller. The number of nodes that communicate with the SDN controller decreases. Secondly, cluster-level routing and local routing are decoupled. The nodes inside the clusters use only distributed local routing and do not need to request flow table entries from the SDN controller. The communication delay caused by requesting flow table entries therefore decreases."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"IV. EXPERIMENTAL SETUP AND RESULTS","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":210.6918106999998,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":338.88624264,"r":511.8562670000001,"t":219.8162110999998},"charspan":[0,34],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/84","text":"IV. EXPERIMENTAL SETUP AND RESULTS"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"In this section, we test and evaluate CluFlow in simulation and a real deployed WSN.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":177.36874818,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.3224,"r":547.4146399999995,"t":198.11755719999996},"charspan":[0,84],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/85","text":"In this section, we test and evaluate CluFlow in simulation and a real deployed WSN."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"A. Benchmark Approaches","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":149.44616575641385,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.3224,"r":409.55095539999985,"t":157.958572},"charspan":[0,23],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/86","text":"A. Benchmark Approaches"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"To evaluate the performance of CluFlow, three benchmark approaches are implemented to calculate the communication flow among clusters.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":107.22806811999999,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":303.3224,"r":547.4146399999997,"t":139.60031714000002},"charspan":[0,134],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/87","text":"To evaluate the performance of CluFlow, three benchmark approaches are implemented to calculate the communication flow among clusters."}],"version":"1.10.0"}